Telecom Customer Loyalty (NPS) Dashboard
Tech Stack: Tableau

Business Goal: Visualize Net Promoter Score (NPS) across a national Russian telecom customer base.

What I did: Created an interactive dashboard that breaks down loyalty scores by demographic (age, gender), technical (device type), and geographic segments.

Outcome: Enabled stakeholders to drill down into specific "detractor" segments to identify root causes of low loyalty.
